# Send the image build only what the Dockerfile copies. Without this, the build
# context is the whole folder: the 6.8 GB .venv, the IBM dataset, chroma_db and
# the local notes in docs/, all copied to the Docker daemon before building.
*
!requirements.txt
!src/
!narratives/
!sources/TYPOLOGY_MAPPING.md
!.streamlit/
**/__pycache__
.streamlit/secrets.toml
